# Canonical development environment for this SDK is devenv:
#
#   devenv shell                     # no direnv needed
#   nix-direnv + `direnv allow`      # this file
#
# The pinned digest after `source_url` is deliberately absent. No hash for
# https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cachix/devenv/main/direnvrc has been observed
# on this host, and writing one here would be a fabricated pin that looks
# verified. `devenv shell` and CI never read this file, so only a direnv user is
# affected; pinning the digest is a one-line local addition once a real hash has
# been fetched and recorded.
if ! has nix_direnv_version; then
  source_url "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/cachix/devenv/main/direnvrc"
fi

use devenv

# `devenv` regenerates these two directories on every shell entry. Neither is
# an input to the build, and `.gitignore` keeps them out of commits; the
# repository's own upstream ignore conventions are untouched.
watch_file devenv.yaml devenv.nix package.nix flake.nix